=begin pod

=head1 NAME

Life::Mathematics - provide Mathematics of Life logic

=head1 SYNOPSIS

=begin code :lang<raku>
use Life::Mathematics;

say add-up("hardwork");   # 98%
say add-up("knowledge");  # 96%
say add-up("attitude");   # 100%
=end code

=head1 DESCRIPTION

The Life::Mathematics distribution provides a simple C<add-up> subroutine
that encapsulates the logic as described in:
L<Mathematics of Life|https://kennysloop.substack.com/p/mathematics-of-life>

=head1 CLI

It also provides a command-line interface called "life-words" that performs
the same logic on each word given.

=begin output
$ life-words hardwork knowledge attitude
hardwork   98%
knowledge  96%
attitude  100%
=end output

